** Probe: BACKGRND SEASON continued over two lines, run for two January
** days. The background-only group BGD must be 1.0 (the winter value) in
** every hour if AERMOD joins the lines into one four-value profile.
** POLLUTID OTHER: SO2 brings 1-hour NAAQS processing, which stopped a
** two-day run in the runtime phase (oracle run 44172179842). Setup there
** reported one SEASON profile, so the two lines were joined.
